      "trigger": "unit_complete:inside-the-atom",
      "title": "Inside the Atom: done!",
      "text": "You did it. That was the last lesson of my unit.\n\nYou can say what is inside an atom now, and why the number of protons matters so much.\n\nHal is next, with atoms that change.",
